<view class="page"><view class="title">导出与备份</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{authorized}}"><view class="card space-top"><view class="section">订单日期范围</view><view class="row"><picker mode="date" value="{{from}}" bindchange="from" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="field">{{from}} ⌄</view></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="date" value="{{to}}" bindchange="to" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="field">{{to}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="note">商品导出包含当前全部商品；订单按下单日期导出，每次可选1至31天。</view><button class="primary space-top" data-kind="products" bindtap="generate" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">导出商品库存表</button><button class="secondary space-top" data-kind="orders" bindtap="generate" disabled="{{busy}}">导出订单表</button><button class="secondary space-top" data-kind="backup" bindtap="generate" disabled="{{busy}}">生成商品与订单备份</button><view class="note space-top">备份包含商品、库存、活动设置和所选日期的订单。图片仅保留引用，不含原始图片文件。订单文件包含收货信息。</view></view><view wx:if="{{file}}" class="card"><view class="section">文件已生成</view><view>{{file.filename}}</view><view class="note">商品 {{file.products}} 款 · 订单 {{file.orders}} 笔</view><button wx:if="{{file.fileType==='xlsx'}}" class="secondary space-top" bindtap="preview">预览表格</button><button class="primary space-top" bindtap="share">保存／发送文件</button></view></block></view>
